  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Using parallelogram law of vector addition, the formula can be written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi>net</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>The data given is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Since the vectors are perpendicular&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi>net</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
